<section id="faq" class="landing-section landing-section--paper">
  <div class="landing-faq">
    <h2>Questions</h2>

    <details class="landing-faq__item">
      <summary>What happens to the text I scan?</summary>
      <p>The document you submit is sent to our servers and to an AI model to produce the report. We don't sell it or use it for advertising, and you can delete your scans at any time.</p>
    </details>

    <details class="landing-faq__item">
      <summary>What counts as a "flagged" clause?</summary>
      <p>Clauses that materially work against you: forced arbitration, class-action waivers, broad content licenses, unilateral changes with no notice, and similar patterns pulled from known predatory language.</p>
    </details>

    <details class="landing-faq__item">
      <summary>How do tokens work?</summary>
      <p>Each document scan uses 1 token. New accounts get 1 free token, and you can buy more anytime — tokens never expire.</p>
    </details>

    <details class="landing-faq__item">
      <summary>Can I delete my account?</summary>
      <p>Yes — you can delete your account at any time, no cancellation window or retention calls.</p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
